---
interface Props { heading?: string | null; }
const { heading = 'Old window → modern replacement' } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="replacement">
  {heading && <figcaption class="heading">{heading}</figcaption>}
  <p class="intro">The easiest way to understand a replacement is to compare the two openings side by side.</p>

  <div class="comparison" role="img" aria-label="Before and after diagram comparing an older window assembly with a modern replacement window.">
    <div class="side old">
      <div class="side-head"><span>BEFORE</span><strong>Older window assembly</strong></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 520 520" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="oldFrame" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#5b5d57"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#77736a"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <rect width="520" height="520" fill="#efece5"/>
        <rect x="108" y="62" width="304" height="360" rx="4" fill="url(#oldFrame)" stroke="#3d403b" stroke-width="5"/>
        <rect x="132" y="86" width="256" height="314" fill="#d9e4df" stroke="#4a4e49" stroke-width="18"/>
        <path d="M142 95 L210 95 L163 160 L142 160Z" fill="#fff" opacity=".26"/>
        <rect x="250" y="88" width="18" height="312" fill="#4a4e49"/>
        <rect x="126" y="207" width="268" height="20" fill="#4a4e49"/>
        <circle cx="259" cy="216" r="7" fill="#b8b8ae"/>
        <path d="M83 195 C61 210,61 240,83 254" stroke="#a74a45" stroke-width="6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M58 191 C28 210,28 242,58 262" stroke="#d06a63" stroke-width="4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".8"/>
        <path d="M95 410 C118 433,148 444,174 444" stroke="#a74a45" stroke-width="6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M346 433 C370 444,400 445,426 432" stroke="#a74a45" stroke-width="6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="callouts">
        <div><b>Older assembly</b><span>Worn frame, older glazing, dated hardware.</span></div>
        <div><b>Perimeter gaps</b><span>Draft cues around the opening.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="swap" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="swap-mark">→</span>
      <span>REPLACE</span>
    </div>

    <div class="side new">
      <div class="side-head"><span>AFTER</span><strong>Modern replacement</strong></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 520 520" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="newFrame" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#24463b"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#557266"/>
          </linearGradient>
          <linearGradient id="newGlass" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#f7fbfa"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#d5ebe4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#b8d7cd"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <rect width="520" height="520" fill="#eef4f0"/>
        <rect x="98" y="54" width="324" height="376" rx="6" fill="#dce5df" stroke="#b2c5bc" stroke-width="12"/>
        <rect x="116" y="72" width="288" height="340" rx="4" fill="url(#newFrame)"/>
        <rect x="142" y="98" width="236" height="288" fill="url(#newGlass)"/>
        <rect x="144" y="237" width="232" height="16" rx="4" fill="#355247"/>
        <rect x="252" y="98" width="16" height="288" rx="4" fill="#355247"/>
        <path d="M162 117 L230 117 L183 182 L156 182Z" fill="#fff" opacity=".42"/>
        <rect x="247" y="233" width="26" height="30" rx="7" fill="#d5ded8"/>
        <rect x="98" y="54" width="324" height="376" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="#2d7d63" stroke-width="5" opacity=".55"/>
        <path d="M88 442 H432" stroke="#6e8278" stroke-width="3"/>
        <path d="M110 453 H410" stroke="#a1b2aa" stroke-width="3"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="callouts">
        <div><b>Modern insulated glass</b><span>Two-pane construction with an insulated space.</span></div>
        <div><b>Tight perimeter seal</b><span>New frame and sealing surfaces close the opening.</span></div>
        <div><b>Finished replacement</b><span>Fresh unit, trim and a clean final opening.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .replacement{margin:0}
  .heading{display:block;margin:0 0 .35rem;font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-display);line-height:var(--leading-display)}
  .intro{margin:0 0 var(--space-l);max-width:74ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:var(--step--1)}
  .comparison{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 80px minmax(0,1fr);align-items:stretch;gap:var(--space-s)}
  .side{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);overflow:hidden;background:var(--paper-raised);box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  .side-head{display:grid;gap:.15rem;padding:var(--space-s) var(--space-m);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .side-head span{font-size:10px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.12em}
  .side-head strong{font-size:var(--step-1)}
  .old .side-head{color:#7d4a42}
  .new .side-head{color:var(--accent-ink)}
  .side svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
  .callouts{display:grid;gap:.6rem;padding:var(--space-m)}
  .callouts>div{display:grid;gap:.18rem;padding:.65rem .75rem;background:var(--paper-sunk);border-left:3px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .old .callouts>div:first-child{border-left-color:#a74a45}
  .old .callouts>div:last-child{border-left-color:#d06a63}
  .new .callouts>div{border-left-color:var(--accent)}
  .callouts b{font-size:var(--step--1)}
  .callouts span{font-size:var(--step--2);line-height:1.35;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .swap{display:grid;align-content:center;justify-items:center;gap:.4rem;color:var(--accent-ink);font-size:10px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.12em}
  .swap-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 40%,var(--line));background:var(--paper-raised);font-size:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  @media(max-width:900px){.comparison{grid-template-columns:1fr}.swap{grid-row:auto;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;justify-items:start;align-items:center;padding:var(--space-2xs) 0}.swap-mark{width:38px;height:38px;font-size:22px}}
</style>
